@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #139D90
 LifeLineBorderColor #A5BFC2
 ParticipantBackgroundColor #183840
 ParticipantBorderColor #183840
 ParticipantFontColor white
 ActorBorderColor #183840
 ActorFontColor #183840
 GroupBorderColor #139D90
 GroupBackgroundColor #EAF6F3
 GroupHeaderFontColor #183840
 NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
 NoteBorderColor #F66B22
}
actor Student
participant Frontend as FE
participant "REST Controller" as API
participant ProfileService as S
database PostgreSQL as DB
title View a public profile | US-04
Student -> FE: Open another student profile
FE -> API: HTTPS GET /api/v1/profiles/{userId}\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>
ref over FE, DB
matching_00_authentication: valid JWT, ACTIVE account, STUDENT role
end ref

API -> S: providePublicProfile(verified principal, userId)
S -> DB: Read target account + profile by UUID
DB --> S: Target data / absent
alt ACTIVE STUDENT with complete profile
 S -> S: Project public fields only
 S --> API: PublicProfile
 API --> FE: 200 OK + PublicProfile
else missing or ineligible target
 S --> API: NOT_FOUND
 API --> FE: 404 + ErrorEnvelope
end
FE --> Student: Public profile or unavailable message
note over S,DB: Target UUID never grants permissions. No email, credentials or private schedule.
@enduml
